DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/7

### 51. C6 Missing task (expect 404, "task 99 not found")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/99
Authorization: Bearer {{suraToken}}

### 52. Broken token (expect 401, "token is invalid or expired")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/mine
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### 53. Task id that is not a number (expect 400, "'id' has the wrong type")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{suraToken}}

### 54. Unknown priority (expect 400, "request body is missing or is not valid JSON")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{kennyToken}}

